  "Question": "On a number line, an open circle is drawn at 2 and a ray extends to the left. The solution set represented is",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(x<2\\)",
    "B": "\\(x\\le2\\)",
    "C": "\\(x>2\\)",
    "D": "\\(x\\ge2\\)"
